{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan! I\u2019m really getting into this healthier lifestyle\u2014just took my friends on an epic hiking trip last Friday!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-25b2608f1f96237c4b029d85", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.718354+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "25b2608f1f96237c4b029d85", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "25b2608f1f96237c4b029d85", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam! That\u2019s fantastic\u2014nothing like a good hike to feel alive. We took the Prius for a long drive to the mountains last weekend. It was perfect until we got into a little scrape on the way back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-7ed56c877874f5f55d46505d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.739507+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ed56c877874f5f55d46505d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ed56c877874f5f55d46505d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Oh no, were you guys okay after the accident?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-86c17c24dd563b1c61f3dac3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.753165+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "86c17c24dd563b1c61f3dac3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "86c17c24dd563b1c61f3dac3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, we were fine, thanks. Just a minor accident, but it put a bit of a damper on telling my work friends about getting married. They\u2019ve been a great support, though."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-cd8bbc8d7785699b54a46deb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.764127+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cd8bbc8d7785699b54a46deb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cd8bbc8d7785699b54a46deb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: I bet they were thrilled to hear about your marriage, despite the mishap!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-24a0b0e0ab7c1f505457530c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.777266+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "24a0b0e0ab7c1f505457530c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "24a0b0e0ab7c1f505457530c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Absolutely, it's been a whirlwind of emotions. Good thing the accident was minor. Just a reminder to take it easy on the road, I guess."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-44bf78c5ae92e14cd050274c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.789767+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "44bf78c5ae92e14cd050274c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "44bf78c5ae92e14cd050274c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: True, it\u2019s important to stay safe. Glad you can still enjoy the peaceful moments after something like that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-1c77906ffd9c79c1b28d2219", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.800932+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1c77906ffd9c79c1b28d2219", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1c77906ffd9c79c1b28d2219", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Definitely, nature brings peace and clarity - it's a great experience."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-bd43487dbffed5842454e6fe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.811442+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd43487dbffed5842454e6fe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd43487dbffed5842454e6fe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Nature can make everything else seem small and help us find peace inside. It reminds us of the bigger picture, you know?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-6469422958c1a5bb850bc5fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.822549+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6469422958c1a5bb850bc5fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6469422958c1a5bb850bc5fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: For sure, and nature has been a great healer. Speaking of which, I\u2019ve got to share some of these new healthy snacks I\u2019ve been trying."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-069ad60dbd2fa337c2bdc92e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.833835+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "069ad60dbd2fa337c2bdc92e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "069ad60dbd2fa337c2bdc92e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: They look healthy and delicious! Perfect for after a hike or, I guess, post-accident recovery, huh?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-c3d11d110b426fb6a9ebb1a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.843728+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c3d11d110b426fb6a9ebb1a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c3d11d110b426fb6a9ebb1a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Exactly! They\u2019re packed with nutrients and really easy to make. You also need to try these cookies, they are awesome! I\u2019ll send you the recipes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-91a90b2169b026260813c8f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.860257+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "91a90b2169b026260813c8f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "91a90b2169b026260813c8f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, I\u2019d appreciate that. It\u2019s good to find new ways to stay healthy. Do you have any healthier snack ideas?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-e9bb45948dfb38bd09975053", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.871491+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9bb45948dfb38bd09975053", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9bb45948dfb38bd09975053", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, I've been trying to eat healthier too. Check out this cool recipe I discovered for these energy balls."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-05047274361e24d331a1f875", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.885359+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05047274361e24d331a1f875", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05047274361e24d331a1f875", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Do you like them? I know they can be an acquired taste."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-6a700872ea9771cb96c5ae2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.898941+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a700872ea9771cb96c5ae2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a700872ea9771cb96c5ae2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I enjoy the taste of these. They're energizing and a healthy way to satisfy your sweet tooth."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-1309e7ed53f42a7349b3e87f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.913195+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1309e7ed53f42a7349b3e87f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1309e7ed53f42a7349b3e87f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Awesome! Always on the lookout for healthy snacks, thanks for the tip!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-8c715ac17004aaee77aee856", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.927027+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8c715ac17004aaee77aee856", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8c715ac17004aaee77aee856", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Glad to help - hope you enjoy it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-10f10414c32e7bb37efce2f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.936374+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "10f10414c32e7bb37efce2f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "10f10414c32e7bb37efce2f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! I'll give these a try. They look yum. Your help means a lot to me. Btw you know what? I went to the store again and, unsurprisingly, had issues with the self-checkout. It's becoming a regular annoyance."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-5143614773bee59f5d7d942c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.947878+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5143614773bee59f5d7d942c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5143614773bee59f5d7d942c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That's very strange, I've never had a problem with it once!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-12da9085d275db400f5ce1a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.961425+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "12da9085d275db400f5ce1a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "12da9085d275db400f5ce1a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Apparently I attract that to me, if you ever want to be in that situation, call me at the store with you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_22-e39a499b033d60ed4dc74efa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:15.975288+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e39a499b033d60ed4dc74efa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e39a499b033d60ed4dc74efa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
